### 视频看盘数据接口测试
### 作者: jxy
### 创建时间: 2026-03-27
### 描述: 后台根据视频ID批量修改关联的混淆数据 API 测试用例

### ========================================
### 基础配置
### ========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json

### ========================================
### 1. 根据视频ID批量修改混淆数据
### ========================================

### 1.1 正常修改 - 修改基础数据字段
POST {{baseUrl}}/replay/words/videoDataViewing/updateByVideoId
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "videoId": "test_video_id_001",
  "totalWatchNum": 10000,
  "averageOnlineNum": 500,
  "averageResidenceTime": 180,
  "incrementFollowerCount": 100
}

### 1.2 正常修改 - 修改销售数据字段
POST {{baseUrl}}/replay/words/videoDataViewing/updateByVideoId
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "videoId": "test_video_id_001",
  "volumeStart": 50000,
  "volumeEnd": 80000,
  "purchaseCountStart": 100,
  "purchaseCountEnd": 200,
  "customerUnitPriceStart": 50.0,
  "customerUnitPriceEnd": 100.0
}

### 1.3 正常修改 - 修改转化率相关字段
POST {{baseUrl}}/replay/words/videoDataViewing/updateByVideoId
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "videoId": "test_video_id_001",
  "convertFanRate": 2.5,
  "interactionPercent": 3.5,
  "goodsConvertRateStart": 1.0,
  "goodsConvertRateEnd": 2.0,
  "gpmStart": 500.0,
  "gpmEnd": 800.0,
  "showWatchCntRatio": 15.0
}

### 1.4 正常修改 - 修改全部字段
POST {{baseUrl}}/replay/words/videoDataViewing/updateByVideoId
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "videoId": "test_video_id_001",
  "totalWatchNum": 15000,
  "averageOnlineNum": 800,
  "averageResidenceTime": 240,
  "incrementFollowerCount": 150,
  "convertFanRate": 3.0,
  "interactionPercent": 4.5,
  "volumeStart": 80000,
  "volumeEnd": 120000,
  "purchaseCountStart": 200,
  "purchaseCountEnd": 300,
  "customerUnitPriceStart": 80.0,
  "customerUnitPriceEnd": 150.0,
  "uvValueStart": 5.0,
  "uvValueEnd": 8.0,
  "goodsConvertRateStart": 1.5,
  "goodsConvertRateEnd": 2.5,
  "gpmStart": 600.0,
  "gpmEnd": 900.0,
  "showWatchCntRatio": 18.0
}

### ========================================
### 2. 数据校验验证
### ========================================

### 2.1 缺少videoId参数（必填字段校验）
POST {{baseUrl}}/replay/words/videoDataViewing/updateByVideoId
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "totalWatchNum": 10000
}

### 2.2 videoId为空字符串
POST {{baseUrl}}/replay/words/videoDataViewing/updateByVideoId
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "videoId": "",
  "totalWatchNum": 10000
}

### 2.3 videoId为null
POST {{baseUrl}}/replay/words/videoDataViewing/updateByVideoId
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "videoId": null,
  "totalWatchNum": 10000
}

### 2.4 请求体为空
POST {{baseUrl}}/replay/words/videoDataViewing/updateByVideoId
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{}

### ========================================
### 3. 错误场景
### ========================================

### 3.1 不存在的videoId
POST {{baseUrl}}/replay/words/videoDataViewing/updateByVideoId
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "videoId": "not_exist_video_id_99999",
  "totalWatchNum": 10000
}

### 3.2 负数值测试（业务上可能不合理，但接口允许）
POST {{baseUrl}}/replay/words/videoDataViewing/updateByVideoId
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "videoId": "test_video_id_001",
  "totalWatchNum": -100
}

### ========================================
### 4. 边界值测试
### ========================================

### 4.1 只传videoId，不传任何修改字段
POST {{baseUrl}}/replay/words/videoDataViewing/updateByVideoId
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "videoId": "test_video_id_001"
}

### 4.2 大数值测试
POST {{baseUrl}}/replay/words/videoDataViewing/updateByVideoId
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "videoId": "test_video_id_001",
  "totalWatchNum": 999999999,
  "volumeStart": 999999999,
  "volumeEnd": 999999999
}

### 4.3 小数精度测试
POST {{baseUrl}}/replay/words/videoDataViewing/updateByVideoId
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "videoId": "test_video_id_001",
  "convertFanRate": 0.001,
  "interactionPercent": 0.01,
  "customerUnitPriceStart": 1.55,
  "customerUnitPriceEnd": 2.55
}

### ========================================
### 5. 完整业务流程测试
### ========================================

### 5.1 步骤1: 修改基础数据
POST {{baseUrl}}/replay/words/videoDataViewing/updateByVideoId
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "videoId": "test_video_id_001",
  "totalWatchNum": 20000,
  "averageOnlineNum": 1000
}

### 5.2 步骤2: 再次修改验证（覆盖之前的值）
POST {{baseUrl}}/replay/words/videoDataViewing/updateByVideoId
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "videoId": "test_video_id_001",
  "totalWatchNum": 25000,
  "averageOnlineNum": 1200
}

### 5.3 步骤3: 只修改部分字段（其他字段保持不变）
POST {{baseUrl}}/replay/words/videoDataViewing/updateByVideoId
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "videoId": "test_video_id_001",
  "interactionPercent": 5.5
}

### ========================================
### 测试数据准备 SQL
### ========================================

# 插入测试数据到 tb_video_data_viewing_confuse 表
# 注意：执行测试前请确保测试数据已准备好

# -- 查询现有混淆数据
# SELECT id, video_id, video_data_viewing_id, total_watch_num, average_online_num, 
#        average_residence_time, data_status, update_date
# FROM tb_video_data_viewing_confuse 
# WHERE video_id = 'test_video_id_001';

# -- 插入测试混淆数据（如果不存在）
# INSERT INTO tb_video_data_viewing_confuse (
#     id, video_id, user_id, tenant_id, video_data_viewing_id, 
#     data_status, create_date, update_date, is_deleted
# ) VALUES (
#     1234567890123456789, 'test_video_id_001', 1, 1, 1001,
#     1, NOW(), NOW(), 0
# );

# -- 插入关联的混淆数据（模拟同一场直播的多段视频）
# INSERT INTO tb_video_data_viewing_confuse (
#     id, video_id, user_id, tenant_id, video_data_viewing_id, 
#     data_status, create_date, update_date, is_deleted
# ) VALUES (
#     1234567890123456790, 'test_video_id_002', 1, 1, 1001,
#     1, NOW(), NOW(), 0
# );

# -- 验证修改结果（检查更新后的数据）
# SELECT id, video_id, video_data_viewing_id, total_watch_num, 
#        average_online_num, update_date
# FROM tb_video_data_viewing_confuse 
# WHERE video_data_viewing_id = 1001;

# -- 清理测试数据
# DELETE FROM tb_video_data_viewing_confuse WHERE video_id LIKE 'test_video_id_%';

### ========================================
### 期望响应格式
### ========================================

# 成功响应示例:
# {
#   "code": 0,
#   "msg": "修改成功，共更新2条记录",
#   "data": null
# }

# 失败响应示例（数据不存在）:
# {
#   "code": 500,
#   "msg": "未找到视频对应的混淆数据",
#   "data": null
# }

# 失败响应示例（参数校验失败）:
# {
#   "code": 400,
#   "msg": "视频id不能为空",
#   "data": null
# }

### ========================================
### 6. 根据视频ID获取数据看盘数据（优先本段数据）
### ========================================

### 6.1 正常查询 - 有本段数据返回本段数据
GET {{baseUrl}}/replay/words/videoDataViewing/dataViewingByVideoId?videoId=test_video_id_001
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 6.2 正常查询 - 本段数据无效返回混淆数据
GET {{baseUrl}}/replay/words/videoDataViewing/dataViewingByVideoId?videoId=test_video_id_002
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 6.3 正常查询 - 无本段数据返回混淆数据
GET {{baseUrl}}/replay/words/videoDataViewing/dataViewingByVideoId?videoId=test_video_id_003
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 6.4 查询不存在的视频ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/replay/words/videoDataViewing/dataViewingByVideoId?videoId=not_exist_video_id_99999
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
# 期望返回 data 为 null

### 6.5 缺少videoId参数
GET {{baseUrl}}/replay/words/videoDataViewing/dataViewingByVideoId
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
# 期望返回参数错误

