### ========================================
### 7. 生成视频场次的看盘数据
### ========================================

### 7.1 正常生成 - 视频开始录制时间在72小时内
GET {{baseUrl}}/replay/videodataviewing/createDataViewing?videoId=test_video_id_within_72h
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
# 期望返回：操作成功

### 7.2 时效校验失败 - 视频开始录制时间超过72小时
GET {{baseUrl}}/replay/videodataviewing/createDataViewing?videoId=test_video_id_over_72h
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
# 期望返回：视频开始录制时间已超过72小时，无法生成看盘数据

### 7.3 视频信息不存在
GET {{baseUrl}}/replay/videodataviewing/createDataViewing?videoId=not_exist_video_id_99999
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
# 期望返回：视频信息不存在

### 7.4 缺少videoId参数
GET {{baseUrl}}/replay/videodataviewing/createDataViewing
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
# 期望返回：参数错误

### 7.5 自动生成模式 - 主播未下播
GET {{baseUrl}}/replay/videodataviewing/createDataViewing?videoId=test_video_id_001&isAuto=1&anchorOnlineStatus=0
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
# 期望返回：主播未下播

### 7.6 自动生成模式 - 视频时长不足50分钟
GET {{baseUrl}}/replay/videodataviewing/createDataViewing?videoId=test_video_short_duration&isAuto=1&anchorOnlineStatus=1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
# 期望返回：视频时长不足50分钟

### 7.7 手动生成模式（非自动）
GET {{baseUrl}}/replay/videodataviewing/createDataViewing?videoId=test_video_id_001&isAuto=0
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
# 期望返回：操作成功或其他业务提示

### ========================================
### 测试数据准备 SQL（生成看盘数据）
### ========================================

# -- 查询视频信息（确认开始录制时间）
# SELECT video_id, video_name, start_time, end_time, duration, batch_number
# FROM tb_anchor_video 
# WHERE video_id IN ('test_video_id_within_72h', 'test_video_id_over_72h');

# -- 模拟72小时内开始的视频（设置 start_time 为当前时间）
# UPDATE tb_anchor_video 
# SET start_time = NOW() - INTERVAL 24 HOUR
# WHERE video_id = 'test_video_id_within_72h';

# -- 模拟超过72小时的视频（设置 start_time 为4天前）
# UPDATE tb_anchor_video 
# SET start_time = NOW() - INTERVAL 96 HOUR
# WHERE video_id = 'test_video_id_over_72h';

# -- 查看数据看盘混淆记录
# SELECT id, video_id, user_id, tenant_id, data_status, request_id, batch_number, create_date
# FROM tb_video_data_viewing_confuse
# WHERE video_id IN ('test_video_id_within_72h', 'test_video_id_over_72h')
# ORDER BY create_date DESC;

# -- 清理测试数据
# DELETE FROM tb_video_data_viewing_confuse WHERE video_id LIKE 'test_video_id_%';

